# Isolated cargo target (agents)

The stop hook runs `scripts/full_check.sh` on repo `target/`. A second
`cargo` on that directory dies in lld (`rustcXXXX` scratch dirs, empty
`= note:`, “could not compile … 1 previous error”).

Before any `cargo` / `rustc` this session:

```bash
export CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/cz_cursor_cargo_target
```

Never write agent builds into the workspace `target/`. Do not start
`scripts/full_check.sh` yourself; stop and let the hook run it.
